<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore mid-distillate stocks highest in 10 mths.</title>
<headline>Singapore mid-distillate stocks highest in 10 mths.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly Singapore middle distillate stocks rose to their highest level since the first week of November 1995, the latest data from the Trade Development Board showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>In the week to September 25, middle distillate stocks rose 879,000 barrels to 8.415 million barrels.</p>
<p>Stocks have not been higher since the week ending November 8, 1995 when middle distillates totalled 8.578 million barrels.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
